```

### 2. Migrate Mason packages list

The Mason packages from chadrc.lua need to be handled by LazyVim's mason-lspconfig integration. LazyVim automatically installs servers listed in opts.servers.

For formatters/linters, use conform and nvim-lint extras.

### 3. Delete obsolete files

- Delete lua/plugins/lsp/configs/mason.lua
- Delete individual settings files after integration
- Keep lsp-lens.lua if customizations are needed
- Keep lspsaga.lua if using it

