### 3. Update statusline pomo_timer integration

The pomo_timer statusline module in serpro69/chadrc_aux.lua needs to stay working:

```lua
pomo_timer = function()
  local ok, pomo = pcall(require, "pomo")
  if not ok then
    return ""
  end

  local timer = pomo.get_first_to_finish()
  if timer == nil then
    return ""
  end

  return "󰄉 " .. tostring(timer)
end,
```

This module is used in chadrc.lua statusline.order configuration.

